## 2. Class Methods

In Java, class methods are also called static methods. The `static` keyword is used to create the class methods.

The class methods cannot access the instance attributes or methods

Let's add a class method to our `Cart` class.

#### Code

```java
class Cart {
    static int flatDiscount = 0;
    static int minBill = 100;

    static void updateFlatDiscount(int newFlatDiscount) {
        flatDiscount = newFlatDiscount;
    }
}
```

> <details open>
> <summary>**Comparison with Python**</summary>
> <br/>
> In Python, the `@classmethod` decorator is used to define the class methods.
>
> #### Code
>
> ```python
