        horse.eat();
    }
}
```

#### Output

```

Horse is eating
```

In the above code, the `eat()` method of the subclass `Horse` has overridden the `eat()` method of the superclass `Animal`.

The `eat()` method of the `Animal` class is said to be overridden method.
The `eat()` method of the `Horse` class is said to be the overriding method.

